{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"超平面丛"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“超平面丛”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"射影空间","text":"射影空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{P}^n(\\mathbb{C})$ 的超平面 $H$ 对应的线丛仍记为 $H$, 其 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hermite向量丛","text":"Hermite 向量丛"}},{"Plain":"结构由\n$$\r\nh = \\frac{1}{1+|t^1|^2+\\cdots+ |t^n|^2}\r\n$$\n给出.</p>\n<p>第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":"\n$$c_1(H,h)= - \\sqrt{-1}\\partial \\bar\\partial \\log h$$</p>\n"}]}}